#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/README.md:34
msgid ""
"CPU 软件层覆盖 M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85。外部工程可通过一份 严格 CPU runtime TOML/事实包使用 `nexus_add_runtime` "
"或安装包的 Runtime component，复用 Core/Arch/I/O face 与选定裸机/FreeRTOS adapter。运行时装配 不生成 SoC、Board、启动或 "
"factory，具体硬件、产品任务和安全策略仍由外部工程 负责。F407/F470 三板维护首发模式，G474/H743/U575 增加精确 GPIO／IRQ UART／ timebase "
"参考装配。G474 另有 selected EXTI，H743 另有固定 Cache 配置与有限 TX DMA，U575 另有独立无 OS 的同步双域参考；这些纵切片不代表全外设或完整 "
"安全域接入，物理 HIL 全部未执行。"
msgstr ""
"The CPU software layer covers M0/M0+/M3/M4/M7/M23/M33/M55/M85. External projects can use "
"`nexus_add_runtime` or the installed Runtime component with one strict CPU-runtime TOML/facts "
"package, reusing Core/Arch/I/O faces and the selected baremetal/FreeRTOS adapter. Runtime assembly"
" generates no SoC, Board, startup or factory; external projects still own hardware, product tasks "
"and security policy. The three F407/F470 Boards maintain launch modes; G474/H743/U575 add exact "
"GPIO/IRQ-UART/timebase reference assemblies. G474 additionally has selected EXTI, H743 fixed Cache"
" configuration and limited TX DMA, and U575 an independent OS-free synchronous split-domain "
"reference. These vertical slices do not represent all peripherals or complete security-domain "
"integration; all physical HIL remains unexecuted."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/README.md:43
msgid ""
"历史 SoC 扩展基线固定源码 `98270512` 已完成全部 Native 契约、工具和配置测试、121 个 ARM 镜像、104 个 CPU runtime 变体、SDK 独立消费及完整 "
"GitHub CI。八个 H743/U575 公开参考配置分别完成两次独立断网构建，ELF/BIN 逐字节一致，并封存为无签名软件 "
"候选；具体范围和原始证据见结果索引。后续文档提交只记录该源码，不继承为新的 代码执行资格。实板未接入，物理 HIL 均为 `not_executed`；运行态交接、DVFS 和 深 STOP "
"连续计时尚未实现，55 项原始退出条件保持不变。"
msgstr ""
"The historical SoC-extension baseline at fixed source `98270512` completed all Native contracts, "
"tool and configuration tests, 121 ARM images, 104 CPU-runtime variants, independent SDK "
"consumption and full GitHub CI. Eight public H743/U575 reference configurations each completed two"
" independent network-disabled builds with byte-identical ELF/BIN and were sealed as unsigned "
"software candidates. Exact scope and raw evidence are in the results index. Later documentation "
"commits only record that source and inherit no new code-execution qualification. Hardware is not "
"connected; all physical HIL is `not_executed`. Runtime handover, DVFS and continuous deep-STOP "
"timing remain unimplemented; the 55 original exit conditions are unchanged."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/README.md:50
msgid ""
"本次构建系统交付绑定 `cc6a065c`，完整结果单独记录在构建结果索引，不能继承 上面的历史 SoC 执行身份。八个当前候选使用 H743 HSI64／Cache off 和 U575 "
"MSIS4／TZEN=0 的 empty／UART、裸机／FreeRTOS 参考组合；这不扩大实板支持。 72 阶段软件总计划未作为一次完整 plan invocation 执行，OCI "
"recipe 重建、 CP311 离线安装和物理 HIL 仍未执行。后续文档提交只记录其精确代码源码。"
msgstr ""
"This build-system delivery is bound to `cc6a065c`; complete results are separately recorded in its"
" build results index and cannot inherit the historical SoC execution identity above. The eight "
"current candidates use H743 HSI64/Cache off and U575 MSIS4/TZEN=0 empty/UART baremetal/FreeRTOS "
"reference combinations; this expands no physical-board support. The 72-stage software master plan "
"was not executed as one complete plan invocation. OCI recipe rebuild, CP311 offline installation "
"and physical HIL remain unexecuted. Later documentation commits only record the exact code source."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/README.md:56
msgid ""
"`docs/archive/` 保留历史设计、结果和旧 Sphinx 教程，不能继承为当前支持或验收。 当前公共 API 文档只从现有公开 include 树生成；代码格式和反斜杠 Doxygen"
" 风格保持 根 `.clang-format`、`.editorconfig` 与现有规范。"
msgstr ""
"`docs/archive/` retains historical designs, results and old Sphinx tutorials; these confer no "
"current support or acceptance. Current public API documentation is generated only from existing "
"public include trees. Code formatting and backslash Doxygen style retain the root `.clang-format`,"
" `.editorconfig` and existing standards."

#: ../../../workspace/nexus-build-system-20261012/docs/delivery/README.md:60
msgid ""
"行为变更遵循 TDD。GoogleTest／GoogleMock 只进入 host 测试目标，生产固件保持 C11。commit hooks 实际执行完整 "
"testing／configure／ci／workflows 四域工具测试 和全部 GoogleTest 契约，拒绝未完成、过滤或跳过的报告。执行结果证明当前合同；真实 RED→GREEN 过程由"
" PR 和原始日志记录。"
msgstr ""
"Behavior changes follow TDD. GoogleTest/GoogleMock enter host test targets only; production "
"firmware remains C11. Commit hooks actually run the complete testing/configure/ci/workflows tool "
"suites and all GoogleTest contracts, rejecting incomplete, filtered or skipped reports. Execution "
"results prove current contracts; actual RED→GREEN history is recorded in PRs and raw logs."

